Assignment tittle: Visual Studio 2.1

Promt For Medium A: Create a realistic watercolor painting of a colorful flower arrangement in a clear glass vase on a wooden table. Include red roses, a large yellow sunflower, white daisies, small purple flowers, and lush green leaves. Use professional wet-on-wet watercolor techniques, layered transparent washes, and soft color transitions to create depth and luminosity. Emphasize expressive brushstrokes, organic shapes, delicate textures, and natural color variation in the petals and foliage. Render the glass vase with subtle reflections, transparency, and visible stems. Add warm natural light, soft shadows, and an atmospheric background. Showcase the texture of watercolor paper and the fluid qualities of watercolor paint. The artwork should resemble a handcrafted fine-art watercolor painting, vibrant, peaceful, balanced, and highly painterly.

Promt For Medium B: Create a traditional black-and-white linocut print of the same flower arrangement in a clear glass vase on a wooden table. Use only black ink on textured paper. Emphasize bold carved lines, visible gouge marks, simplified organic shapes, strong contrast, and negative space. The artwork should resemble a handmade relief print with rich texture, balance, and a classic monochrome linocut style.
